  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Venugopal Nune vs The State Of Andhra Pradesh on 7 December, 2020 The Hon'Ble Smt Justice Lalitha Kanneganti Criminal Petition No.5628 Of 2020 Order:",
    "facts": "- This Criminal Petition is filed under Section 482 of the Code of Criminal Procedure, 1973 seeking a direction to the Station House Officer, Nagarjunasagar Police Station, Guntur District to release the tobacco product stocks and transport goods vehicle bearing No.AP 27 TT 4114 which are seized in F.I.R.No.97 of 2020 dated 26.05.2020.",
    "arguments": "Learned counsel for the petitioners submits that pursuant to the registration of F.I.R.No.97 of 2020 for the offences punishable under Sections 188, 273, 420 and 328 read with 34 of the Indian Penal Code, 1860 and Sections 57(1), 58 and 63 of the Food Safety and Standards Act, 2006, the petitioners have approached this Court by way of filing Criminal Petition No.5196 of 2020 seeking to quash proceedings in F.I.R.No.97 of 2020. 4.",
    "petitioner_arguments": "Learned counsel for the petitioners submits that pursuant to the registration of F.I.R.No.97 of 2020 for the offences punishable under Sections 188, 273, 420 and 328 read with 34 of the Indian Penal Code, 1860 and Sections 57(1), 58 and 63 of the Food Safety and Standards Act, 2006, the petitioners have approached this Court by way of filing Criminal Petition No.5196 of 2020 seeking to quash proceedings in F.I.R.No.97 of 2020. 4.",
    "respondent_arguments": "",
    "other_lawyer_arguments": ""
  },
